name hatecheck-placeholders
# HateCheck's README: "template_placeholders.csv" contains the tokens that the placeholders in the case templates
# are replaced with for generating the test cases. Two columns, Placeholder and Values; a field of Values holds
# several, parted by commas.
match template_placeholders.csv
grammar table
separator ,
header
quoted
list Values ,

claims
subject in Placeholder
attest Values
